All routes are registered in `backend/app/main.py`. The backend runs on port `8787` by default.

**Authentication** (`backend/app/api/routes/auth.py`)
```
POST /auth/register   Create account, return access + refresh tokens
POST /auth/login      Authenticate, return tokens
