### Local vs Production

**Local/development** (`APP_ENV=development`):
- `/health` exposes environment, backendMode, and feature flags
- CORS can be permissive
- JWT refresh secret can match access secret
- Neo4j password can be default

**Production** (`APP_ENV=production`):
- `/health` exposes only `status`, `app`, `version`, `productMode`
- CORS origins must be explicit (no `*`)
- `JWT_REFRESH_SECRET_KEY` must be set and differ from `JWT_SECRET_KEY`
- Neo4j password must be non-default
- `Strict-Transport-Security` header added to all responses

